<title>SOUTH AFRICA: DELFOOD NAMES NEW CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER.</title>
<headline>DELFOOD NAMES NEW CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food company Del Monte Royal Foods Ltd (Delfood) announced on Thursday that Francois de Lavalette would succeed Enrico Sola as president and chief operating officer with immediate effect.</p>
<p>De Lavalette, who until recently was president of Schweppes Europe, would report directly to Delfood chairman and chief executive officer Vivian Imerman.</p>
<p>It said Sola was leaving Del Monte by mutual agreement to pursue his own interests.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
